	(descr "Board-only GND landing pad for a spring finger or conductive gasket to the display's metal back (Rev3.0 EMC round, panel bond). Copper 8.0 x 7.0 mm, solder-mask opening 6.0 x 5.0 mm (pad mask margin -1.0 mm: the bare ENIG landing area), no paste, solid zone connection. The 1.0 mm masked copper rim carries the GND vias 0.6/0.3, placed on the board (not in the footprint) by tools/pcb_emc/s2_plan.py: none inside the bare area, so the landing area stays flat. Place on B.Cu. Not a BOM item, not in position files.")
